Third-party codes excluded from the CC BY 4.0 licence (research/care-by-country/):

- ATC codes (the `atc` value in `drugCodes`, and scripts/codes/drug-codes.json) are
  material of the WHO Collaborating Centre for Drug Statistics Methodology, Oslo.
  They are NOT covered by this repository's CC BY 4.0 licence. Terms:
  https://atcddd.fhi.no/copyright_disclaimer/ (attribution required; no commercial
  copying or distribution; no changes to the material). Only bare codes are stored,
  with no ATC names, hierarchy or DDDs. Do not include them in any open release
  until the WHOCC confirms this use.
  Attribution: ATC codes from the WHO Collaborating Centre for Drug Statistics
  Methodology, ATC/DDD Index, https://atcddd.fhi.no/atc_ddd_index/.
- ICD-11 codes, titles and URIs (`conditionCodes`) are WHO material under CC BY-ND 3.0
  IGO (https://icd.who.int/en/docs/icd11-license.pdf), not this repository's CC BY 4.0.
  Citation: International Classification of Diseases, Eleventh Revision (ICD-11),
  World Health Organization (WHO) 2019, https://icd.who.int/browse11. Licensed under
  CC BY-ND 3.0 IGO.

